  "description": "Backend-neutral generation types for Starling's chat models: generation options, results, streamed updates, finish reasons, usage and per-token log probabilities; the stop-sequence matcher and the UTF-8-safe incremental detokenizer over the owned tokenizer Starlings.Tokenizers; chat turns, tool definitions and tool calls with the IChatTemplate and IToolCallParser seams; a ModelProfile record of a pinned checkpoint; Python json.dumps and str() formatting of JSON values as chat templates write them; an asynchronous IGenerationSequence seam for decode backends; and the Microsoft.Extensions.AI finish-reason and usage mapping. No ONNX Runtime dependency: the ONNX Runtime GenAI backend is Starlings.Generation.OnnxGenAI. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
